    "latex_longtable" produces a tabular environment that can stretch along
    multiple pages, using the longtable package for LaTeX.

    >>> print(tabulate([["spam", 41.9999], ["eggs", "451.0"]], tablefmt="latex_longtable"))
    \\begin{longtable}{lr}
    \\hline
     spam &  41.9999 \\\\
     eggs & 451      \\\\
    \\hline
    \\end{longtable}
